# Agent: Claude Haiku 5.5 through OpenRouter (an OpenAI-compatible endpoint), settings.openai.toml (max_tokens 16000).
# Start the harness with --proxy https://openrouter.ai/api/v1 and OPENAI_API_KEY set to an OpenRouter key.
# Scores are not comparable with runs on the aws/ route: another provider, another default sampling path.
AGENT_SETTING_CONFIG=settings.openai.toml
MODEL_NAME=anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5
